  m_text: "\t        August 14, 2070\n   Log entry. Yesterday, I attempted to shut
    down the AI. I failed, however, because the AI fought back\u2014and what\u2019s
    more, it tried to kill me. This is deeply disturbing. The AI flooded the room
    with gas, but it didn't know I was wearing my spacesuit. I couldn't regain control
    of the ship. I can only hope that the AI won't do anything to harm me or my crew."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
