    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\t    August 13, 2070\n   Log entry. We have notified headquarters of
    another malfunction. This time, it involves the ship's oxygen generation system.
    The entire crew is now wearing spacesuits. We have oxygen reserves, but they
    might not last very long. We urgently request the mechanic\u2019s arrival as
    soon as possible."
