      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\t\t  \t   August 11 2070 \n   Log entry, Crew Commander Mike speaking.
    I hereby report that the Machine has not failed us so far. The generator is producing
    a steady power supply, and the AI is holding the course, ensuring our comfort.As
    for our current position, we have bypassed the Moon and Mars, and we are now
    approaching the asteroid belt. We can only hope we won\u2019t collide with any
    space debris. The AI has just engaged the antimatter drive, which will significantly
    accelerate our journey out of the solar system. Navigating through the asteroid
    belt poses a severe risk of impact. If anything goes sideways, please send a
    mechanic."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 4ebc437ae59a32342a2e3252f4569657, type: 2}
