  m_text: "\t     August 13, 2070\n   Log entry. I have a feeling that the AI might
    have veered off course. I\u2019ve decided to head into the server room and shut
    the AI down, so I can take manual control of the ship myself. The mechanic still
    hasn\u2019t arrived, but from what I know, he is close. He should be here within
    two days."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
