      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\t\t    August 12, 2070\n   Log entry, Mike speaking. We made it through
    the asteroid belt unscathed, but a few hours later, our generator suffered a
    minor malfunction. We decided to request a mechanic, who is already en route.
    We hope it\u2019s nothing serious and can be easily fixed. As I always say, it's
    better for things to break down at the beginning rather than at the end. The
    AI failed to repair the generator, but it is still holding the course. We are
    hoping for the mechanic\u2019s arrival as soon as possible."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 4ebc437ae59a32342a2e3252f4569657, type: 2}
