  m_text: "\t  August 15, 2070\n   Log entry, Crew Commander Mike speaking. We hereby
    inform you that everything is functioning perfectly. The generator is fully operational
    now, and the oxygen system is producing oxygen correctly. Please cancel the mechanic's
    dispatch."
