      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\t\t\t   August 14, 2070\n   Log entry, Chief Medical Officer James speaking.
    Our AI has mutinied. It cut off our oxygen across the entire ship and activated
    the security grid. We had to evacuate the room immediately, suit up, and grab
    the keycards. However, there were only four spacesuits and keycards available
    in that sector. Under these catastrophic circumstances, we lost five astronauts:
    William, Oliver, Benjamin, Henry, and our Second-in-Command, David. He gave me
    his own suit and keycard, telling me to take command of the remaining crew. Right
    now, we are hiding from the drones and robo-spiders controlled by the AI, and...
    Oh no, they found us! We have to ruuuuuun..."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 4ebc437ae59a32342a2e3252f4569657, type: 2}
